#: gtk/src/lab_page.rs:259 qt/qml/LabCanvas.qml:32
msgid ""
"Combine LUTs, grades and profile conversions: chained or mixed, each with "
"its own intensity.\n"
"E.g. a Fujifilm LUT for F-Log becomes a LUT for V-Log or for the Standard "
"profile."
msgstr ""
"Combina LUT, grade e conversioni di profilo: in catena o in miscela, ognuno "
"con la sua intensità.\n"
"Es. un LUT Fujifilm per F-Log diventa un LUT per V-Log o per il profilo "
"Standard."

